  "description": "I transmigrated as the wife of a cursed archduke in my own twisted novel. As the author, I took responsibility and set things right by lifting the curse, which was the key to returning home. I thought my job was done, and just when I was finally trying to go back, the archduke asked me, \"Did you really think I wouldn't know that you’re planning on returning to your fiance?\"\n\nHe had completely misunderstood!\n\n\"Whether you like it or not, I'm still your husband. I'm never letting you go back to that bastard.\"\n\nAll I want is for him to please let me go home!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61473089), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%9D%91%EB%A7%89-%EB%8C%80%EA%B3%B5%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%A7%91%EC%B0%A9%EC%9D%80-%EC%8B%AB%EC%96%B4%EC%9A%94/3398) (both expired)",
